# Instruction review worksheet

| Field | Entry |
|---|---|
| Instruction ID and source revision | [value] |
| File / lines / surrounding heading | [value] |
| Condition | [when it applies] |
| Action | [observable operation or decision] |
| Expected evidence | [what establishes success] |
| Failure / uncertainty behavior | [stop, partial result, retry, recovery] |
| Authority and effect | [source of authorization; resources changed or disclosed] |
| Host assumptions | [tools, paths, metadata, lifecycle] |
| Conflicts / duplicate owners | [locations or none found] |
| Decision | keep / rewrite / move / implement in code / remove / needs verification |
| Reason and proposed wording | [specific change] |
| Evaluation case | [independent outcome/negative case] |

An automatic topic tag or grep match is a review lead, not a verdict.
